# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Autonomous Supply Chain — AWS AgentCore Environment Config
# Copy to .env.aws and fill in your values
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── AWS Core ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
AWS_ACCOUNT_ID=your-12-digit-account-id

# ── Bedrock Models ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Vision Agent: Claude 3.5 Sonnet for image analysis + code execution
BEDROCK_VISION_MODEL_ID=anthropic.claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022-v2:0
# Logistics Agent: Claude 3 Haiku for fast structured output
BEDROCK_LOGISTICS_MODEL_ID=anthropic.claude-3-haiku-20240307-v1:0

# ── Bedrock Knowledge Base (Supplier Agent) ──────────────────
# Run agentcore/setup/provision_knowledge_base.py to get this ID
BEDROCK_KNOWLEDGE_BASE_ID=
BEDROCK_DATA_SOURCE_ID=

# ── AgentCore Runtime ─────────────────────────────────────────
# IAM role ARN created by deploy-agentcore.sh
AGENTCORE_RUNTIME_ROLE_ARN=arn:aws:iam::YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID:role/AgentCoreRuntimeRole
# AgentCore Gateway ID — output from first deploy
AGENTCORE_GATEWAY_ID=
AGENTCORE_GATEWAY_ENDPOINT=

# ── Agent URLs (local dev — same ports as before) ────────────
VISION_AGENT_URL=http://localhost:8081
SUPPLIER_AGENT_URL=http://localhost:8082
LOGISTICS_AGENT_URL=http://localhost:8083

# ── Google OAuth (MCP Integrations — unchanged from GCP setup) ──
OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id
OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-oauth-client-secret
OAUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN=your-google-oauth-refresh-token

# ── AWS Secrets Manager (production — replaces OAuth in .env) ──
# Set these to the Secrets Manager ARNs if running in AgentCore Runtime
AGENTCORE_OAUTH_SECRET_ARN=
